~ start
Enemy Interaction Elder: The animals can get jumpy when the void acts up... We will try to wrangle them back to safety!
Enemy Interaction Elder: It's a good idea to learn how to interact with all sorts of creatures in Threadbare, some friendly and some not so much.
Enemy Interaction Elder: Don't let your guard down during these quests!
do balloon.hide()
do show_storybook()
if chosen_quest == null:
	% Enemy Interaction Elder: I understand, it took me a while to be comfortable navigating StoryVore caves.
	% Enemy Interaction Elder: This is a good place to test your speed and agility when you need it!
	% Enemy Interaction Elder: When you're ready, these quests will give you a better idea of what you're up against!
else:
	% Enemy Interaction Elder: Wow, you're brave! Good luck out there.
	% Enemy Interaction Elder: Move quickly and use hiding spots to your advantage!
	% Enemy Interaction Elder: Don't forget to pay attention to how creatures move along paths!
=> END
